      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikukwinza kaŋelu wumu wahadi aŋelu atanu nayedi, akweti yeŋa yakunama yitanu nayiyedi, hakuhosha nanami nindi, Inzaŋa kunu nikuleji chakusompeshawu owu chivumbi muneni, washakama hameji amavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanta ankanu aheseki aneli nindi wuvumbi, ashakama heseki anasheti vinyu yawuvumbi windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunsenda mudi Spiritu, hakuntwala mwisaŋa. Hinukumona mumbanda nashakami hakanyama kachinana, kenzala majina akutuka Nzambi ho-o, kakweti nyitu yitanu nayiyedi ninseŋu ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda navwali mahina awusombu niachinana, wadileŋaleŋa nawuru natumalola twalema wuseya, nimperola. Kuchikasa chindi kudi lupasa lwawuru lwenzala yishimashima, yoyuma yawuzondu yawuvumbi windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hehama dindi ha nawu, Nsaŋu yakujinda, Babiloni muneni, mama yawayivumbi niyayishi mashima yaheseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumona mumbanda nasheti dehi mashi awakwakujila, nimashi awayinsahu akukoola Yesu. Chinamumoni nihayama nikuhayama nankashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu hakuŋila nindi, Wunahayaminidi? Tiya nikuleji nsaŋu yakujinda yamumbanda, niyakanyama kanamweleki kadi nanyitu yitanu nayiyedi ninseŋu ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kanyama wunamoni kadiŋuku, katataka kwosi, keŋa katupuki mwikela, keŋa kayi nakukisika. Antu ashakama heseki, anabuli kusonekawu majinawu mumukanda wawumi wasonekeluwu dehi kufumisha haaliluwu chikuku champata yamunu mwishina, akahayama chakamonawu kanyama kadiŋuku, katataka kwosi, hikakwinza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenimu mudi yitoŋojoka yama ana. Oyu nyitu yitanu nayiyedi himpidi jitanu najiyedi hashakamaŋayi mumbanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyanyanta ankanu nawa atanu nayedi; atanu anaholoki dehi, wumu wekala kwoku, mukwawu kanda enzi; chakenzayi wakashakama kapinji kanti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu kanyama kadiŋuku, katataka kwosi, yomwenindi diyi mwanta wamu chitanu nachisatu nawa, hiwumu wahadi akwawu atanu nayedi; hakuya nakukisika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oju nseŋu ikumi ŋawunamoni hiyanyanta ankanu ikumi, achidi kanda atambuli wanta; ilaŋa akatambula wanta neyi anyanta ankanu, hamu nakanyama, mpinji yimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa akweti muchima wawu wumu wakumwinka kanyama Ŋovu yawu niwanta wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa akaasa njita naKana kamukoku; Kana kamukoku wakayimika mushindu, muloŋa diyi Mukulumpi wawakulumpi, diyi Mwanta wawanyanta; ninawa adiyi nawu atambikewa, atondewa, ashinshika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Meji amavulu iwamona hashakamaŋayi chivumbi, hiyantu amumatuŋa, himazaza, hinyuza, hiyakwamadimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninoju nseŋu ikumi jiwamona, ninaka kanyama, akamuhela chivumbi, akamubalumuna kwikala chihembi hohu, akamuleka nzekesi, akadya mujimba windi, akamushita nakesi bwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Nzambi nashi munyichima yawu jakwila mwafuukulayi, kulonda atiyaloŋani amwinki kanyama wanta wawu, ndo nichakalumbuluka mazu aNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda wamona hiŋanda yeneni yayulaŋa anyanta ankanu aheseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
